       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QLLPC02.
      * LATE PAYMENT CHARGE AND CIC PAST-DUE FLAG
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DAYS-PAST-DUE          PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-AMT-AFTER-DUE          PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-LPC-RATE               PIC 9V9(4) VALUE .0300.
       01  WS-LATE-CHARGE            PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-CIC-PAST-DUE           PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-DAYS-PAST-DUE
           ACCEPT WS-AMT-AFTER-DUE
           PERFORM 2000-ASSESS
           DISPLAY 'CHARGE: ' WS-LATE-CHARGE ' CIC: ' WS-CIC-PAST-DUE
           STOP RUN.
       2000-ASSESS.
      * DAYS PAST DUE COUNT FROM THE STATEMENT PAYMENT DUE DATE.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-LATE-CHARGE
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-CIC-PAST-DUE
           IF WS-DAYS-PAST-DUE > 3
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-CIC-PAST-DUE
              COMPUTE WS-LATE-CHARGE ROUNDED =
                      WS-AMT-AFTER-DUE * WS-LPC-RATE
           END-IF.
